{
 "goal": "Say *too…*, *so…!* and *not very*: 太好了, 太大了, 不太好.",
 "blocks": [
  {"text": "太 (tài) + adjective + 了 means *too…*, or *so…!* when it's something nice. It's stronger than 很 (G03) and shows how you feel."},
  {"pattern": "太 + adjective + 了", "english": "too … / so …!"},
  {"ex": [
   ["[太]好[了]！", "[Tài] hǎo [le]!", "Great!"],
   ["我[太]高兴[了]。", "Wǒ [tài] gāoxìng [le].", "I'm so happy."],
   ["这个[太]大[了]。", "Zhège [tài] dà [le].", "This one is too big."],
   ["你[太]快[了]。", "Nǐ [tài] kuài [le].", "You're too fast."],
   ["[太]多[了]！", "[Tài] duō [le]!", "That's too much!"]
  ]},
  {"text": "Without 了 it sounds unfinished: say 太好了, not just 太好."},
  {"wrong": [
   ["太好！", "Tài hǎo!", "Add 了: 太好了！"]
  ]},
  {"h": "不太: not very"},
  {"text": "不太 + adjective, without 了, is a gentle *not very*. It's how people say something isn't good without sounding harsh."},
  {"pattern": "不太 + adjective", "english": "not very …"},
  {"ex": [
   ["我[不太]好。", "Wǒ [bú tài] hǎo.", "I'm not so good."],
   ["这个[不太]大。", "Zhège [bú tài] dà.", "This one isn't very big."],
   ["我[不太]明白。", "Wǒ [bú tài] míngbai.", "I don't quite understand."]
  ]},
  {"tip": "不太 is said bú tài: 太 is a 4th tone (G04)."}
 ],
